@gateway = http://localhost:5100

### Gateway: health
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Danh sach sinh vien dang hoc
GET {{gateway}}/api/students?status=active

### Tong hop: sinh vien 1 + cac dang ky + hoc phan
GET {{gateway}}/api/students/1/overview

### Tong hop, loc theo hoc ky
GET {{gateway}}/api/students/1/overview?semester=2026-1

### Tong hop, loc theo trang thai dang ky
GET {{gateway}}/api/students/1/overview?status=completed

### Tong hop: hoc phan 1 + sinh vien da dang ky
GET {{gateway}}/api/courses/1/overview

### Loi 404: sinh vien khong ton tai
GET {{gateway}}/api/students/999/overview

### Cap nhat trang thai sinh vien
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/students/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### Loi 400: trang thai khong hop le
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/students/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "abc"
}

### Dang ky hoc phan hop le (chay lan 2 se bi 409)
POST {{gateway}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "courseId": 2
}

### Loi 409: sinh vien da tot nghiep
POST {{gateway}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 5,
  "courseId": 2
}

### Loi 404: hoc phan khong ton tai
POST {{gateway}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 999
}